{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\DeckRecurrence\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-tools-in-root",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "phpunit/phpunit is in require-dev of composer.json. The manual recommends a vendor-bin/ of bamarni/composer-bin-plugin per tool, so that the dependencies of a tool cannot conflict with those of the app."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-deprecated",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Cron/ArchiveDoneCards.php:26 OCP\\App\\IAppManager::isInstalled(): deprecated since Nextcloud 32; Use either self::isEnabledForUser or self::isEnabledForAnyone",
        "lib/Cron/SpawnRecurringCards.php:26 OCP\\App\\IAppManager::isInstalled(): deprecated since Nextcloud 32; Use either self::isEnabledForUser or self::isEnabledForAnyone",
        "lib/Service/ArchiveService.php:142 OCP\\DB\\QueryBuilder\\IQueryBuilder::PARAM_DATE: deprecated since Nextcloud 31; use PARAM_DATETIME_MUTABLE instead"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "3 uses in 3 files of the public API that is deprecated in Nextcloud 30 to 32. The text of the tag names the replacement where it has one.",
        "  lib/Cron/ArchiveDoneCards.php:26 OCP\\App\\IAppManager::isInstalled(): deprecated since Nextcloud 32; Use either self::isEnabledForUser or self::isEnabledForAnyone",
        "  lib/Cron/SpawnRecurringCards.php:26 OCP\\App\\IAppManager::isInstalled(): deprecated since Nextcloud 32; Use either self::isEnabledForUser or self::isEnabledForAnyone",
        "  lib/Service/ArchiveService.php:142 OCP\\DB\\QueryBuilder\\IQueryBuilder::PARAM_DATE: deprecated since Nextcloud 31; use PARAM_DATETIME_MUTABLE instead"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "job-time-sensitivity",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Cron/ArchiveDoneCards.php OCA\\DeckRecurrence\\Cron\\ArchiveDoneCards",
        "lib/Cron/SpawnRecurringCards.php OCA\\DeckRecurrence\\Cron\\SpawnRecurringCards"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "2 timed jobs do not say whether they are time sensitive. A job that sets TIME_INSENSITIVE with setTimeSensitivity() is moved to the maintenance window of the server; whether a job is heavy enough for that only its maintainer knows.",
        "  lib/Cron/ArchiveDoneCards.php OCA\\DeckRecurrence\\Cron\\ArchiveDoneCards",
        "  lib/Cron/SpawnRecurringCards.php OCA\\DeckRecurrence\\Cron\\SpawnRecurringCards"
      ]
    },
